        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p12_s2"
      },
      "text": "According to Wikipedia, Parsijoo.ir is the second most popular search engine in Iran after Google and it uses the Parsijoobot to crawl websites for indexing purposes.",
      "language": "en",
