        "page": 12,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p12_s7"
      },
      "text": "Ravand Cybertech hosted a number of domains used by an Iranian Ministry of Intelligence Services (MOIS) agent, Massoud Khodabandeh, in a disinformation campaign conducted in Western media.",
