        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p15_s1"
      },
      "text": "The best operators are not always the most devout or loyal to the regime and we assess that, in this case, the IRGC may forgo careful contractor selection and planning in an attempt to deliver a destructive attack within a short period of time.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
